        │
        ▼
run_round_inference  --max-instances 6 --mode track
        │
        ▼
<view>.slp  (round8_260723_strictmouth)
        │
        ├─► visualize_predictions          (2D overlay QC)
        ├─► track_simple_nn top_cam        → top_cam.tracks.csv
        │
        └─► reconstruct_from_slp
              --num-candidates 6           (must see "3D best-assign")
              --use-visible-node-centroid
              --bind-top-id
                │
                ▼
              *_3d.csv
              *_3d_identified.csv  (final_fish_id)
              *_best_pre_link.json
                │
                ▼
              rerun_viewer  /  optional SAM2 re-bind
```

