## Gotchas

1. `--num-candidates 6` is not optional for `--max-instances 6` `.slp`.
2. `--use-visible-node-centroid` is the production 3D point (mouth+tail
   centroid). Mouth-only anchoring is for comparison experiments.
3. `--max-jump-hard-cap-mm 80` stops a long NaN gap from adopting a
   different fish. Effective gate at gap N = `min(8*N, 80)` mm.
4. Refractive backend: `--calibration-backend auto`. Do not carry
   `--max-residual-per-fish 5000` into this run.
5. `visualize_predictions` needs `--slp` when files live in a round
   subfolder.
6. 3-node August models are on disk but cannot be launched by
   `run_round_inference.py` (expects `<view>/runs/<tag>.centroid_n*`
   and `.centered_instance_n*`).
)
